734
00:26:13,940 --> 00:26:14,780
being that close

735
00:26:14,780 --> 00:26:15,700
to a friend

736
00:26:15,700 --> 00:26:17,300
of the opposite sex.

737
00:26:18,190 --> 00:26:18,670
Okay.

738
00:26:18,670 --> 00:26:19,620
The first one is,

739
00:26:20,030 --> 00:26:22,340
