Okay, Haitao's eyes are open.

744
00:26:33,790 --> 00:26:35,070
You're already out on the first one.

745
00:26:35,350 --> 00:26:35,820
No, it's not that.

746
00:26:35,820 --> 00:26:36,620
It depends on

747
